  ],
  "notes": [
    "Use additional fields from the Orders section, not Users.",
    "GetCourse callback variables for order custom fields use the full field title in {object.FIELD_TITLE}; titles must not contain dots.",
    "The two fields carry nonce/revision correlation only; they do not prove legal consent.",
    "The documented callback uses a shared Bearer secret, not a GetCourse provider digital signature.",
    "created_at must be verified in a controlled callback; do not enable if the emitted value is not ISO-8601 with timezone."
  ]
